        "s2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-4",
      "text": "El Retiro Park is a few minutes' walk from the hotel.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-5",
      "text": "The hotel's rooms and suites were designed by the Parisian designers Gilles & Boissier.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-6",
      "text": "Chef Quique Dacosta oversees all culinary operations at the hotel's restaurants and bars.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-7",
      "text": "Palm Court sits underneath a crystal canopy ceiling.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-8",
      "text": "The Ritz Garden is open all year round, weather permitting.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-9",
      "text": "Pictura is a cocktail bar with a museum-inspired mural behind the bar counter.",
      "source_ids": [
        "s7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f-10",
      "text": "The hotel's fitness centre has Technogym equipment.",
